        "url": "https://zenodo.org/"
      },
      "abstract": "A bilingual, machine-readable authorial publication comprising four operational interpretation boundaries, one reflexive authorial definition, and one temporal process premise. It prevents technical proxies from being silently promoted into stronger epistemic, relational, normative, or phenomenal statuses, while preserving open-ended self-interpretation and becoming as distinct questions.",
      "hasPart": [
        {"id": "urn:ivankotov:statement:future-not-event-process:v1.0"},
